          "expr": "(sum(count_over_time({service_name=\"coders-modulo-4-api\"} |= \"HTTP request completed\" | statusCode=~\"5..\" [$__range])) or vector(0)) / sum(count_over_time({service_name=\"coders-modulo-4-api\"} |= \"HTTP request completed\" [$__range]))"
